msgid "NPC_BROTHER_ALDREN_NAME"
msgstr "Brother Aldren"

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_INTRO"
msgstr "Ah, the new keeper. The cemetery has been quieter than I expected. That's usually a bad sign."

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_OPTION_FIRST_TASK"
msgstr "What should I do first?"

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_OPTION_TURN_IN_FIRST_TASK"
msgstr "I've prepared the two planks."

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_OPTION_IDENTITY"
msgstr "Who are you?"

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_OPTION_NIGHT"
msgstr "What happens here at night?"

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_OPTION_TRUSTED"
msgstr "You seem less suspicious of me now. Anything else I should know?"

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_OPTION_GOODBYE"
msgstr "I should get back to work."

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_FIRST_TASK_RESPONSE"
msgstr "Start with something hard to ruin: prepare two decent planks. The old fences are running out of excuses."

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_TURN_IN_FIRST_TASK_RESPONSE"
msgstr "They'll do. Curious... one still carries a very old inventory mark. Leave it. There'll be time for old paperwork later."

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_IDENTITY_RESPONSE"
msgstr "Brother Aldren. I keep the chapel, the records, and occasionally my patience."

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_NIGHT_RESPONSE"
msgstr "Don't stay awake. What comes out at night isn't friendly."

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_TRUSTED_RESPONSE"
msgstr "Perhaps. Trust makes old doors easier to open, and old records harder to ignore."

msgid "DIALOGUE_ALDREN_GOODBYE_RESPONSE"
msgstr "Try not to dig anywhere that whispers back."

msgid "QUEST_ALDREN_FIRST_DUTY_TITLE"
msgstr "A Simple Job"

msgid "QUEST_ALDREN_FIRST_DUTY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Prepare two decent planks for cemetery repairs and return to Aldren."

